Z||000019||KitKar||09-24-2000||03:28 PM||||One thing I would be concerned about painting my dash is glare. I would think that having a bright colored dash would cause unacceptable amounts of glare on the windshield. Especially if the dash was yellow. Any one experience this?<BR>I don't know what kind of kit that second car is but it is cool! Don't like the nose though.<P>------------------<BR>Rick Lord<BR>Webmaster<BR>http://www.KitKar.com||||reg||1
